1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:57,410
Mei Ji
Third Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan
9-Leaf Shaman

25
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,440
I didn't expect

26
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,000
that you would have

27
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,920
a strand of my domain.

28
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,970
Domain ?

29
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,400
Brother...

30
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:28,530
That soul fragment I got from the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor

31
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,760
was actually hers.

32
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,810
Who are you ?

33
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,800
The cultivators back then

34
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:41,540
called me Mei Ji.

35
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:41,540
Note: "Mei Ji" means "Enchantress"

36
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,610
But in the Forsaken Immortal Clan,

37
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:46,610
I am the Third Ancestor.

38
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,890
So you're the Third Ancestor.

39
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:51,010
Junior trespassed here by mistake.

40
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,650
I won’t hang around.

41
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,610
Farewell.

42
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,250
Senior, what do you mean by this ?

43
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,120
Compared to "Third Ancestor"

44
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:05,680
I’d much prefer you call me Mei Ji.

45
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:08,560
Since you’ve come here today...

46
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,040
I'll let you leave

47
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,720
if you do as I say.

48
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,640
Third Ancestor,

49
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,640
do you know what this is ?

50
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,400
The Billion-Soul Flag !

51
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,650
Since you're hiding here,

52
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:24,410
it means you must be injured.

53
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,490
Senior, don’t force my hand.

54
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,930
I will now take my leave

55
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,760
and Senior will continue to recover.

56
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:47,360
What a cautious little cultivator.

57
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:50,290
The more I look at you, the more I like you.

58
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:53,680
No one that I fancy

59
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,160
can get away.

60
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,760
Go,

61
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,200
capture him and bring him back here.

62
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:03,690
Tattoo Beast Atlas

63
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:13,000
This scroll feels familiar...

64
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,400
This scroll...

65
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:19,120
why is it similar to our holy treasure ?

66
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:21,610
The holy treasure of the Forsaken Immortal Clan...

67
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:39,210
How can he also have a Tattoo Beast Atlas !?

68
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,090
This is bad !

69
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,490
Dragon, tiger, retreat !

70
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,920
Which Ancestor is she ?

71
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:16,760
She willingly sealed herself inside the Tattoo Beast Atlas...

72
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,120
Who the hell is

73
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,960
this little cultivator ?

74
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,810
After tens of thousands of years...

75
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,440
This old man has finally returned !

76
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:53,290
Situ Nan
Early stage Ascendant

77
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,720
Senior Situ,

78
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,490
congratulations.

79
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:05,720
Although I haven’t fully recovered my cultivation,

80
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,040
it’s more than enough for this tiny planet Suzaku.

81
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:13,640
Now, let’s extract your soul strand from the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

82
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:28,530
Ancestral Spirit
Forsaken Immortal Clan

83
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,680
Greetings, Ancestral Spirit.

84
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:35,130
South of the
Suzaku Continent

85
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:37,720
Greetings, Ancestral Spirit.

86
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:41,650
Clan members, heed my order.

87
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,450
Begin the chant !

88
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,320
Begin the chant !

89
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,360
Begin the chant !

90
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:33,640
The current forces of Suzaku

91
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:36,530
are powerless against the Forsaken Immortal Clan.

92
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:41,160
The two of you will face a life or death trial today.

93
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,360
Whether you can survive it

94
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:46,000
will depend on your fate.

95
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:02,690
The Fifth Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan

96
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,570
pays respects to Zhuque Zi.

97
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:13,810
Sha Zi
Young Patriarch of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan

98
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:13,210
The Young Patriarch of the Forsaken Immortal Clan

99
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,930
pays respect to Zhuque Zi.

100
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:23,330
This humble woman

101
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,080
also pays respects to Zhuque Zi.

102
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,320
Senior Brother,

103
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:34,120
it has been 3 months.

104
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,320
Have you made your decision ?

105
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,400
You also must have

106
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,320
an 11-Leaf Shaman.

107
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:45,200
Let me see him.

108
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:05,760
You promised to split planet Suzaku in two

109
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:09,560
because you fear the Cultivation Planet Heart in my hands.

110
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:14,040
If not for it, you would've attacked me long ago.

111
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:17,010
Why do you bother with all this nonsense ?

112
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,890
However...

113
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:21,930
if I give you the Cultivation Planet Heart,

114
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:24,730
wouldn’t that make me some meat on your cutting board !?

115
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:26,650
I would be at your mercy !

116
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,240
Senior Brother,

117
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,970
I understand your concerns.

118
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:34,160
This is a Soul-Binding spell.

119
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:39,040
It will bind your life to the Cultivation Planet Heart.

120
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:41,960
If my clan betrays you and kills you,

121
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:45,160
the Cultivation Planet Heart will shatter as well.

122
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,400
My clan

123
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:48,360
would perish with you.

124
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,490
With this spell,

125
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:53,250
you can live out your natural lifespan.

126
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,800
Senior Brother,

127
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:58,080
we don’t want to destroy planet Suzaku.

128
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:01,520
We just want a way to coexist.

129
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:04,160
Now give me the Cultivation Planet Heart

130
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,760
and this war can be avoided.

131
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:08,800
Planet Suzaku will be split in two

132
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,360
and both sides won't interfere with each other.

133
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:17,520
As expected of my dear Junior Brother,

134
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,840
you’ve calculated everything.

135
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:22,400
Since you know me so well,

136
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:26,120
what choice do you think I’ll make now ?

137
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,330
Zhuque Zi,

138
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,050
you’re already at a dead end.

139
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,760
Now accept your defeat !

140
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:34,650
Suzaku Seal...

141
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,530
attack !

142
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,880
What ?!

143
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,210
The Fifth Ancestor

144
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,770
was killed in an instant ?!

145
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:53,450
We cannot do anything

146
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,360
against Suzaku Seal attacks

147
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:57,480
fueled by your lifespan.

148
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,360
Senior Brother,

149
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:01,680
your lifespan will be exhausted

150
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:05,200
if you unleash one more strike.

151
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:08,360
War or peace,

152
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:11,640
I need your answer.

153
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,280
Junior Brother,

154
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,800
do you remember our master,

155
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,160
the previous Suzaku,

156
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,080
Qian Pinghai ?

157
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:33,210
You really betrayed him well !

158
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,560
Qian Pinghai,

159
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:36,850
you were wrong back then !

160
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:37,920
Terribly wrong !

161
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:41,440
If you still have a soul, take a good look

162
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:44,810
at the beloved disciple you appointed as the next Suzaku !

163
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:46,240
You chose

164
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:49,960
a descendant of the Forsaken Immortal Clan !

165
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,440
Qian Pinghai,

166
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:56,640
Yunque Zi and I joined the sect together

167
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:59,080
and our talents were similar.

168
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:02,760
But you always favored him

169
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,360
while I

170
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,680
was the odd one.

171
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:10,600
Just as I lost all hope,

172
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:13,240
you made me forget it

173
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:16,680
by passing me the Suzaku Formation,

174
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:18,530
the legacy of the Suzaku.

175
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:22,280
I gave it my all to learn to use it.

176
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,130
But I realized

177
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:27,600
that the Suzaku Formation is a double-edged sword !

178
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:31,280
Each use damages the Origin Soul.

179
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:33,920
How could you be so cruel !?

180
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:38,280
You taught me how to be the Suzaku

181
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:41,040
but never intended to pass the title to me !

182
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,840
You never imagined

183
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:46,680
I’d steal the Cultivation Planet Heart before your death

184
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:49,050
and claim the title of Suzaku for myself

185
00:12:48,830 --> 00:12:52,490
even if I wasn't the one you appointed !

186
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:59,370
Junior didn't even bury your corpse in the Suzaku Tomb,

187
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:01,520
I sold it to the Corpse Sect !

188
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:06,280
This was the only way to alleviate my anger !

189
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,240
Qian Pinghai,

190
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:10,000
the truth is

191
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:13,480
that I was the most suited to become the Suzaku !

192
00:13:15,280 --> 00:13:18,090
I bear no hatred towards the Forsaken Immortal Clan.

193
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:21,160
But my hatred towards you and him is limitless !

194
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,080
Junior Brother,

195
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:26,680
how could I possibly share this planet with you ?

196
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:30,320
If I can’t be the first Suzaku,

197
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:33,480
then I will be the last !

198
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:39,120
I choose neither of your options.

199
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:42,770
Cultivation Planet Heart

200
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:41,330
We will play

201
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,360
a little game together.

202
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,680
If you win

203
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:47,840
then planet Suzaku is yours.

204
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,880
But if you lose,

205
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:55,480
then everyone on planet Suzaku will die !

206
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,680
What are you doing !?

207
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,040
Break !

208
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:03,880
The Cultivation Planet Crystal is in the Suzaku Tomb !

209
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:07,360
All cultivators under Ascendant

210
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:10,280
may enter the Suzaku Tomb.

211
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:14,200
You can try to retrieve your soul strands

212
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,480
or try to get the Cultivation Planet Heart.

213
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:20,240
But know that when I finally crush this thing to dust,

214
00:14:20,760 --> 00:14:23,810
all those who didn't retrieve their soul strand

215
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:27,120
will die alongside the Cultivation Planet Crystal !

216
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,130
Be careful !

217
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:34,280
I will give you 3 months.

218
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,400
You're insane ! You're insane !

219
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:39,400
The Suzaku Tomb is open.

220
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:40,880
Everyone,

221
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:44,120
the game has begun !

222
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,080
This damn brat !

223
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,650
He dared to crush the Cultivation Planet Heart,

224
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:51,970
he's courting death !

225
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:54,050
You need your soul strand

226
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:54,880
in order to survive.

227
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,970
Those who can’t reach the Suzaku Tomb

228
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,920
will all die !

229
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:58,880
Hurry !

230
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,050
What should we do ?

231
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,370
You're asking now !?

232
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,650
If we had not started this war,

233
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:13,250
we wouldn't be in such a mess !

234
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:16,280
Now the lives of our clan are in his hands !

235
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:19,490
We must play by his rules.

236
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:25,560
Send all members below 9-Leaf to the Suzaku Tomb.

237
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,680
Proceed with caution.

238
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,650
The rest of us

239
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,250
will look for a solution.

240
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:32,490
Understood.

241
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,010
This old madman

242
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,650
doesn't want to die alone

243
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:05,890
so he's trying to drag us all down with him !

244
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,810
Life and death are up to fate.

245
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:11,210
We must now go out separate ways.

246
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:13,720
Qian Feng,

247
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:16,960
remember to use the Suzaku Formation.

248
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:18,800
And also...

249
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:26,210
This doll is made from celestial iron.

250
00:16:26,160 --> 00:16:29,200
When you're in danger,

251
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:32,130
activate its mechanism

252
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:34,840
and it will save your life.

253
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:36,490
Understood.

254
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,440
Master.

255
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,960
Qian Pinghai...

256
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:50,730
I found your descendant,

257
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:54,080
he has the same Spirit Root you had.

258
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:59,920
And I treat him just as you once treated me back then.

259
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:06,130
Our plan is in shambles,

260
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:08,120
I can no longer enter the Suzaku Tomb now...

261
00:17:09,120 --> 00:17:10,530
You'll have to rely on yourself

262
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,600
to retrieve your soul strand.

263
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:14,370
The Suzaku Tomb isn’t large,

264
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:15,690
it's divided into the inner and outer tomb.

265
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,480
You'll first enter the outer tomb.

266
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:20,890
A single sweep of Divine Sense should help you find an altar.

267
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,930
Pass through it to enter the inner tomb.

268
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,930
There is a mountain at the center,

269
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:27,280
that is Ye Wuyou’s tomb.

270
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:29,400
Find the crystal

271
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,290
and retrieve your soul strand.

272
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:35,130
If you encounter danger and need to leave,

273
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:37,250
this is the method to break my restrictions.

274
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:39,250
It should get you out safely.

275
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,290
Understood.

276
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,850
Thank you, Senior.

277
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:47,530
Entrance of the
Suzaku Tomb

278
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:47,200
The Suzaku Tomb is opening too slowly...

279
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:49,490
How can it already be full ?

280
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,530
Since higher cultivation realms entered first

281
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:53,810
this delays everyone else for no reason !

282
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:02,170
How is this any different from waiting for death ?

283
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:04,680
I can’t see through him...

284
00:18:04,760 --> 00:18:06,930
This person isn’t to be trifled with.

285
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,560
How much longer must we wait ?

286
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:09,610
Stop !

287
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:11,370
Fellow cultivator,

288
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,680
follow the rules.

289
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,970
The Soul Transformation seniors already entered.

290
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,680
Since we arrived here first,

291
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,450
it will be our turn next.

292
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:21,170
Since you were late,

293
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,690
you need to wait in the queue.

294
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:28,760
Don't be rude !

295
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,280
I am Brutal Nan Ming,

296
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:32,970
my disciple is ignorant.

297
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,810
Please forgive us, Senior.

298
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:40,760
Master,

299
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:42,610
what's his cultivation level ?

300
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:44,530
Why can’t I sense

301
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,920
any spiritual energy from him ?

302
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:47,960
Of course you can't.

303
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:51,650
He has shed his mortal roots and must be Late stage Soul Transformation.

304
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:54,320
Only celestial spiritual energy flows through his meridians.

305
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:57,130
Ordinary cultivators can't see through him.

306
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:09,410
It’s open !

307
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:11,680
It’s open,

308
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,400
go !

309
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:13,800
Quick !

310
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:14,840
Hurry inside !

311
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:15,400
Move !

312
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:16,920
That gaze…

313
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:19,320
It feels familiar...

314
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:24,160
Wang Lin...

315
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:26,800
You don’t recognize me now,

316
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,720
but I didn't forget about you.

317
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,480
We...

318
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:36,160
haven’t met each other in a long time.

319
00:19:57,930 --> 00:20:01,480
To let go of the consequences of my actions

320
00:20:01,230 --> 00:20:03,200
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

321
00:20:02,990 --> 00:20:05,140
like scattered ink.

322
00:20:05,770 --> 00:20:12,620
As destiny falls

323
00:20:08,610 --> 00:20:12,620
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

324
00:20:12,370 --> 00:20:20,220
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

325
00:20:15,610 --> 00:20:20,220
wither and melt into rivers.

326
00:20:20,410 --> 00:20:27,780
Who can deceive

327
00:20:23,170 --> 00:20:27,780
the law of the heavens ?

328
00:20:27,850 --> 00:20:31,100
Countless generations

329
00:20:29,130 --> 00:20:31,100
have tried before me.

330
00:20:31,140 --> 00:20:34,820
But how could I not catch my dreams

331
00:20:32,970 --> 00:20:34,820
within my warm fingers ?

332
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:38,900
You're at my side when I'm alone

333
00:20:38,650 --> 00:20:42,220
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

334
00:20:42,730 --> 00:20:46,180
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

335
00:20:46,290 --> 00:20:50,380
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

336
00:20:48,130 --> 00:20:50,380
in the streets.

337
00:20:50,290 --> 00:20:55,340
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

338
00:20:51,850 --> 00:20:55,340
Can I break the rules ?

339
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:58,060
To run towards you !

340
00:20:57,850 --> 00:21:01,380
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

341
00:21:01,130 --> 00:21:06,020
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

342
00:21:05,770 --> 00:21:09,420
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

343
00:21:09,210 --> 00:21:14,100
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

344
00:21:14,300 --> 00:21:19,780
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

345
00:21:19,650 --> 00:21:23,700
If your soul is willing to wander,

346
00:21:23,450 --> 00:21:28,340
can I still take your hands

347
00:21:25,130 --> 00:21:28,340
and hold them tight ?

348
00:21:28,250 --> 00:21:31,420
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

349
00:21:31,170 --> 00:21:36,300
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

350
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:39,580
I dream of destroying

351
00:21:39,490 --> 00:21:44,300
the shackles of our fate.

352
00:21:44,050 --> 00:21:48,260
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

353
00:21:48,010 --> 00:21:51,060
You're the hardest to let go of.

354
00:21:50,890 --> 00:21:54,940
I want to be with you again

355
00:21:54,770 --> 00:21:58,300
so I can look in your eyes.

356
00:21:58,330 --> 00:22:03,540
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
